>   _sumstats.do -- helper: descriptive statistics table, POOLED + BY YEAR
> 
>   Usage (data already loaded, must contain variable year):
>       do "$B202/_sumstats.do" "gj_per_va ln_gj_per_va" "large" "t03_firm_stat
